<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/james-frederick-ferrier> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Scottish metaphysician (1808-1864), professor at St Andrews, who introduced the word \"epistemology\" into English in his Institutes of Metaphysic (1854) and paired it with \"agnoiology\", a theory of ignorance holding that we can be ignorant only of what could in principle be known." .
