<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/venn-diagram-test> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A visual decision procedure for categorical syllogisms: draw three overlapping circles for the three terms, record only what the premises say (shading for empty regions, an X for \"at least one\"), and the argument is valid exactly when the conclusion can be read off the finished diagram." .
